@startuml "Feedback Admin Handle Sequence"
actor "Ban quản lý" as Admin
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "FeedbackController" as FC
participant "FeedbackService" as FS
participant "FeedbackDAO" as FDAO
database "CSDL" as DB

Admin -> FE: Chọn phản ánh
FE -> FC: POST /api/feedbacks/{id}/status
FC -> FS: updateFeedbackStatus(id, status, adminResponse)
FS -> FDAO: update status/response
FDAO -> DB: UPDATE feedbacks
DB --> FDAO: OK
FC --> FE: 200 OK

Admin -> FE: Xóa phản ánh (tuỳ chọn)
FE -> FC: DELETE /api/feedbacks/{id}
FC -> FS: deleteFeedback(id)
FS -> FDAO: delete
FDAO -> DB: UPDATE deleted_at
DB --> FDAO: OK
FC --> FE: 200 OK
@enduml
